{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"One day, two children found a big basket full of mixed toys.","words":[[0,0.24],[0.3,0.69],[0.86,1.04],[1.11,1.51],[1.58,1.85],[1.9,1.95],[2.02,2.23],[2.32,2.77],[2.83,3.04],[3.1,3.17],[3.26,3.55],[3.6,4.46]]},{"text":"Cars, blocks, balls, and dolls were all mixed together.","words":[[0,0.6],[0.67,1.13],[1.18,1.65],[1.67,1.82],[1.92,2.32],[2.38,2.58],[2.62,2.81],[2.88,3.16],[3.18,4.04]]},{"text":"It felt messy. They decided to put similar things together.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.27,0.52],[0.6,1.13],[1.37,1.58],[1.65,2.1],[2.15,2.19],[2.26,2.46],[2.54,2.98],[3.06,3.35],[3.4,4.27]]},{"text":"All the cars went into one group.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.34,0.41],[0.48,0.89],[0.96,1.17],[1.23,1.45],[1.59,1.81],[1.87,2.55]]},{"text":"All the blocks went into another group.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.34,0.41],[0.46,0.82],[0.88,1.13],[1.18,1.41],[1.5,1.85],[1.92,2.6]]},{"text":"Then they grouped the balls together.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.34,0.48],[0.56,0.91],[0.93,1],[1.07,1.44],[1.5,2.37]]},{"text":"Now everything looked neat and organized.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.34,0.78],[0.85,1.13],[1.17,1.41],[1.46,1.58],[1.66,2.69]]},{"text":"They noticed something else — they could sort by color too!","words":[[0,0.26],[0.33,0.71],[0.73,1.14],[1.22,1.53],[1.59,1.68],[1.89,2.09],[2.14,2.37],[2.45,2.8],[2.87,3.01],[3.1,3.48],[3.56,4.37]]},{"text":"Sorting helped them see how many toys were in each group.","words":[[0,0.56],[0.65,0.92],[0.94,1.1],[1.2,1.43],[1.5,1.67],[1.75,1.99],[2.06,2.39],[2.45,2.66],[2.73,2.84],[2.98,3.24],[3.32,4.09]]},{"text":"From that day on, they learned that sorting makes the world easier to understand.","words":[[0,0.29],[0.36,0.57],[0.65,0.91],[1.01,1.5],[1.79,2],[2.06,2.35],[2.37,2.54],[2.63,3.12],[3.2,3.47],[3.52,3.59],[3.67,4.02],[4.1,4.47],[4.54,4.63],[4.72,5.94]]}]}